--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
libspelling (the C library)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This gem defines its classes from libspelling-1's GObject Introspection
typelib, Spelling-1.typelib, which it reads at require time. The spell checking
is done by that library: it is GNOME Text Editor's and Builder's spell checker.

  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libspelling
